{"agent":"Monster3-SEG-durations-record-7267fe","data":{"body":"Follow-up of SEG-durations-record. Accept: (1) the unit_tests gate records junit durations into .ddflow/local/durations.json as ci does (reuse services/durations.capturing/stage_env); (2) the suite queue cost predictor (services/suitequeue.predicted_cost via suitelock, which has no repo handle today) falls back to the recorded file seconds when no run of its kind is measured; (3) ddflow metrics suitewaste reads the store. Test first for each. Falsifier: predicted cost differs from the measured median of the same kind by more than 2x on the replay of the last 50 runs. Size S.","globs":["ddflow/services/gates/runner.py","ddflow/services/suitelock.py","ddflow/services/suitequeue.py","ddflow/services/perf/suitewaste.py","tests/test_durations_consumers.py"],"line":"","needs":["SEG-durations-record"],"parent":"P-segments","tags":["segments","speed","wave:1"],"title":"Durations consumers: queue cost predictor, suitewaste and unit_tests read and record the store"},"id":"eac5fe1c53e12f13e059ff516","kind":"task.added","lamport":189667,"schema":1,"subject":"SEG-durations-consumers","ts":"2026-11-13T04:32:28.499935Z"}
